# REVIEWED CONFIGURATION FRAGMENT, NOT A COMPLETE DAEMON CONFIG.
# Merge with the approved distribution's config; validate actual supported directives.
# Keep existing database/log/socket/user paths appropriate to the host.
TCPAddr 127.0.0.1
TCPSocket 3310
ScanPDF yes
HeuristicAlerts yes
AlertEncryptedDoc yes
AlertExceedsMax yes
AlertBrokenMedia yes
StreamMaxLength 11M
MaxFileSize 11M
MaxScanSize 100M
MaxScanTime 30000
MaxRecursion 16
MaxFiles 1000
MaxThreads 2
# Enable and monitor freshclam/signature updates. Gateway rejects definitions >48 hours old.
# Real tests must prove detection and fail-closed behavior, including parser/embedded-content
# and scan-limit cases. A config fragment does not certify detection effectiveness.
